# `?` inside the functions browser shows its usage help.
NAME=functions browser help
FILE=malloc://128
ARGS=-a x86 -b 64 -c "wx 554889e5897dfc8b07c3"
COLS=80
ROWS=24
STEPS=<<STEPEOF
KEYS Vv<ENTER>
WAIT 400
KEY ?
WAIT 300
EXPECT_REGEX Usage: vv
EXPECT_REGEX Actions supported:
EXPECT_REGEX Keys:
EXPECT_REGEX functions: +Add, Modify, Delete, Xrefs Calls Vars
EXPECT_REGEX variables: +Add, Modify, Delete
EXPECT_REGEX j,k +select next/prev item or scroll if tab pressed
EXPECT_REGEX enter +enter function view \(variables\), xrefs
QUIT
STEPEOF
